Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,работали,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Над серией работали:\N Лилия, Тирамису, Бирюлька, Хозяин, Зингер, Фундук
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.05,0:01:06.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.69,0:01:08.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,19 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:58.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:03.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What did you do with Soyeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:19.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Answer if you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn’t do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.36,0:02:23.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I just opened my eyes and found myself in the body of this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:29.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where is the real Soyeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:30.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:33.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t know if she’s alive or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:40.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:53.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:29.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How long have you been in Soyeon’s body?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:33.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Since the day I woke up after falling into the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:38.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You said you know everything about me and Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:42.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All of her memories suddenly came back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:10.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Get up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,unless you want to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:22.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hold my hand until we get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:25.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-What are you planning?\N-If there are her memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:30.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,so Soyeon is still inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:34.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Try to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:49.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The woman you're in love with...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:58.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:01.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t want to harm you, get out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:07.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How self-confident!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:18.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The Minister of War disobeyed the order!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:22.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,From now on, I give the orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:23.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Yes!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:44.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are bleeding heavily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:45.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We need to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:02.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:06.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is a list of conspirators.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:08.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Protect yourself with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you remember how we played hide and seek as children?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:23.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will count to 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:24.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and you will hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:27.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:29.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He's chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:39.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:44.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:46.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And don’t look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:53.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Save Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:09.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm counting to 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:32.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:48.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,5, 6...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:04.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:06.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:25.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,9, 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:58.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I asked you not to look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:10.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Follow the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:35.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:42.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Come here. Let's take a walk together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:46.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,When I first meet the king, I will pin up my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:48.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Can you help me choose a hairpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:51.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She shouldn't be fancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and I don’t want the regular one either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:55.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Look ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:18.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:26.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,always looked at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:30.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I saw you like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:36.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,you didn’t know yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.88,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:46.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:51.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,don’t understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:46.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She didn't go far. Find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:08.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:11.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Search everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:12.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Yes!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:02.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:02.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What should I do alone with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:07.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t even know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:12.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:16.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I couldn’t do anything when people were dying before my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:18.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:27.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:29.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I try,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,some things are not meant to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:52.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay. Take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:57.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s over anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:32.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The man who rose from the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:37.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:41.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:42.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:04.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:07.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You’re alive, everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,That's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:13.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everyone died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:15.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lady Choi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hong Young and Kim Byungin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:22.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everyone died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:25.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is Kim Byungin dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:28.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He died because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:31.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everyone died because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:35.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,My queen, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:42.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hong Young and Lady Choi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:45.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.18,0:18:51.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:53.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hong Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:00.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:04.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Where is Lady Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:07.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:08.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:14.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Oh no. Lady Choi.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.87,0:19:18.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,As expected, it is dangerous outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:20.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It probably hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:22.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Insanely painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:25.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:26.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,this means that I will not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:33.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,With a mortal wound, I would not feel pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:37.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But he swung his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:39.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let's say I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:41.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:48.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,He didn’t use the sword well, that also saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:57.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I really thought something happened to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:20:00.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:04.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sorry. I didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:07.63,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Is everything okay?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:08.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:13.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where have you been, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:16.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I searched the whole forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:18.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But I couldn’t find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.57,0:20:21.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,A lot of people were looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:25.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But the king found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:43.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-We missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:47.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:50.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:51.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:07.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Needs rinsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:16.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:20.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why did you go into the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:22.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You haven’t been back for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:24.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:27.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You always surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:28.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There was no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:31.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Without you in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:37.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,it was like an eclipse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:40.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wherever I went, there was darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:44.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:46.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’ll explain what an eclipse is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:49.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No need to explain. I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.73,0:21:53.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I felt the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The pain in my soul was stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:03.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,body pain from wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:13.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I won’t leave you alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.06,0:22:18.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:16.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Are you seriously injured?\N-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.89,0:23:19.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,With medicine I’ll be good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Did you find out who attacked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.91,0:23:44.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I saw a familiar face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.10,0:24:01.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tonghak followers!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.31,0:24:20.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I saw the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.39,0:24:36.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The king lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.50,0:24:40.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The king lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.67,0:24:43.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.31,0:24:46.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,A state of emergency has been declared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.18,0:24:48.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How dare a woman walk around alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:55.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Cho's rejected concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.22,0:24:58.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’m ashamed to appear in public,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.42,0:25:01.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,wanted to get some fresh air while no one was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.76,0:25:04.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous on the streets now. Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:06.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I understand. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.11,0:25:20.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The greedy Kim clan tried to kill the king
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.38,0:25:22.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and frame the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.18,0:25:25.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Fate decided to leave the king alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.48,0:25:28.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is it possible to occupy a throne that is already occupied?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.95,0:25:31.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The king lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.03,0:25:43.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.60,0:25:47.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It was on the streets, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.40,0:25:50.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What is there to make so much noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.64,0:25:56.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.58,0:26:02.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The king lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:07.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If so, then the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.29,0:26:11.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,left not to come to her senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.33,0:26:16.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.30,0:26:20.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun saw right through Kim Byungin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:23.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that he foresaw Benin’s betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.34,0:26:28.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The gentleman wants us to remain silent about the death of Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.84,0:26:30.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Yes, father.\N-However,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:34.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,we have now established relations with Jvagyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.72,0:26:38.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But they missed the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.79,0:26:41.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We must try
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.93,0:26:44.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,make amends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.37,0:26:57.47,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Wow! If you boil it so much, it will completely soften.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:26:58.97,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:01.88,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,After the queen left to recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.88,0:27:03.41,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,he lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.15,0:27:06.11,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They say that hatred makes you more deeply attached than love.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.02,0:27:10.09,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I think he became very attached to her while she was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.40,0:27:24.27,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that the king died in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.07,0:27:29.30,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,He sincerely cared about his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.08,0:27:38.88,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,As expected, you are alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.55,0:27:47.56,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Yes, no one is waiting for me at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.29,0:27:53.26,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Her Majesty is also very depressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.03,0:27:57.13,Default,Spiky2,0,0,0,,I don’t even know what to tell you, court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.33,0:27:59.00,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your very existence
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.14,0:28:02.77,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,already comforted and reassured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.77,0:28:06.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I even forgot about the complaints for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.08,0:28:10.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I feel the same thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.88,0:28:16.49,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.49,0:28:17.79,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.35,0:28:20.09,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I'm a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.52,0:28:24.29,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Just a minute. I have something to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.43,0:28:30.80,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.57,0:28:36.94,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:39.54,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'm not in a position to express
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:43.28,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,these feelings, so
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:45.65,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,you must
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.82,0:28:49.25,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,meet a good woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.09,0:28:52.12,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,to brighten up your loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.56,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.87,0:29:10.97,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I felt that something was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.97,0:29:13.64,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,How is the cooking going?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.21,0:29:16.18,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.78,0:29:18.35,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Royal Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.71,0:29:20.72,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Ah, I ruined everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:23.75,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,It’s a rare sight to see how a royal cook spoils food.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.12,0:29:25.25,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.25,0:29:27.69,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with me. Something happened to the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.79,0:29:29.93,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Panic gripped the south of the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.19,0:29:32.66,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So in the last days no gifts have been received.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.89,0:29:34.26,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Royal cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.10,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I heard that strange appeals are posted on the streets of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.40,0:29:40.94,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Those who attacked the king...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.94,0:29:44.34,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If not the followers of tonhak, who else will do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.34,0:29:47.81,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,We need to execute them all. Catch and kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.88,0:29:52.68,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kill? Do you even know how to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.58,0:29:54.75,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,So shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.68,0:29:56.82,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.53,0:30:11.70,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I wore it too long. I started to get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.63,0:30:14.77,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I think it’s time to take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:19.37,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You can handle it, right? You worked with me for 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.41,0:30:21.44,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.71,0:30:26.88,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.95,0:30:29.58,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,And who will cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.09,0:30:32.89,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,There are many in Joseon who can be a royal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.99,0:30:36.19,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.43,0:30:44.63,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,In recent days, strange appeals have appeared on the streets of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.57,0:30:48.04,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,They say we are talking about rumors about the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.74,0:30:50.11,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.31,0:30:52.54,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Are rumors important now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.87,0:30:55.91,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Everything will be over after the coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.95,0:30:59.08,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What should we worry about now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.08,0:31:01.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,so this is the letter on which our lives depend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.85,0:31:05.82,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,It is suspicious that Kim Byonin is not visible these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:09.96,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The Queen has left to prepare for childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.23,0:31:11.79,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And Kim Byungin also disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.16,0:31:16.57,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The death of the king and the departure of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.60,0:31:18.37,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Somehow everything is suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.34,0:31:23.74,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And if both are lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.07,0:31:26.24,Default,Spiky2,0,0,0,,He hid the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.58,0:31:28.34,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,who considers the king’s death to be imaginary,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.34,0:31:31.08,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,and took her side?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.08,0:31:33.35,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Then Kim Byonin signed the letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.22,0:31:38.72,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,to destroy the Kim clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.39,0:31:45.93,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.06,0:31:48.16,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:57.01,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,How awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.81,0:32:00.91,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.19,0:32:13.36,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,As soon as you left, it suddenly got colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.62,0:32:18.69,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Are you cold because I wasn’t around?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:26.74,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Thank you for your boundless love.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.34,0:32:30.27,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,2, 3, 1, 1, 2, 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.27,0:32:31.81,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,2, 1, 2, 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.81,0:32:34.71,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,- 4, 1, 2, 3, 4.\N-Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.41,0:32:36.51,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.68,0:32:39.68,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,The training you told about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.38,0:32:42.32,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,So that’s why you wrote a textbook on military tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.58,0:32:45.39,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I can’t believe that the king is a follower of donghak.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.12,0:32:49.93,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I even hid it from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.86,0:32:54.03,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Like a merchant dissatisfied with the country that helps him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.03,0:32:56.90,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Why are you doing such dangerous things?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.20,0:32:59.33,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,They say the enemy of your enemy is your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.04,0:33:03.34,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Corrupt officials are our common enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.04,0:33:07.34,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Isn’t the scope too small?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.78,0:33:08.88,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.88,0:33:10.58,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Do you want us to get together and kill us at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.91,0:33:13.78,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Everyone will gather at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.98,0:33:16.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,In the meantime, it’s safer to be apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.79,0:33:19.39,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Are you in charge here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.39,0:33:20.49,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.52,0:33:22.59,Default,Spiky2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.59,0:33:24.76,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:26.66,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:28.70,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.30,0:33:30.33,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,-1, ​​2, 3. Eight.\N-Glad to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.80,0:33:33.00,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your face shows that you are in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.13,0:33:35.67,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The scar on the eye is especially impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:37.41,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:41.38,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The main one here is the one who lives longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.38,0:33:43.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,As soon as one dies, the next one becomes the main one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.35,0:33:47.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Being in charge means surviving the longest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.25,0:33:51.95,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If I die, he will become the boss here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.95,0:33:54.36,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Nine. 1, 2, 3. Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.49,0:33:55.82,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,This baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.42,0:33:58.43,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I heard you are close with my Damhyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.29,0:34:00.46,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,My Damhyang?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.50,0:34:02.86,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,So you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.86,0:34:05.90,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,He is Damhyang's father, whom we were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.97,0:34:09.30,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The one whose eye was damaged with a pitchfork?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:11.61,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,It’s a small world!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.41,0:34:15.71,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for Damhyang, I would have already killed this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.71,0:34:17.58,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Meet the damn king,\N who brought the country to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.58,0:34:20.35,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'll cut his throat right away. That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.12,0:34:22.85,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Thanks to your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.85,0:34:26.32,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You could have died trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.06,0:34:28.12,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.33,0:34:31.63,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.63,0:34:34.46,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You just had to finish it off with a straw knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.46,0:34:35.66,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,3. Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.33,0:34:38.17,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,How many times do we have to repeat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.63,0:34:40.90,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You should feel it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.27,0:34:43.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Should I say this every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.77,0:34:49.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Damhyan saved you. And she also saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.54,0:34:51.75,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The king does not abandon his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.58,0:34:54.25,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,So the people save the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.58,0:34:58.35,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,By the way, what happened to the warriors who were chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.42,0:35:01.79,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Many were born and raised here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.79,0:35:03.66,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,They are hunters and gatherers of herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.66,0:35:05.46,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Know the mountains like the back of their hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.46,0:35:08.33,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The guards can’t get them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.63,0:35:10.70,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What about the strange guy in the tokkebi mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:11.93,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Did you grab him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.03,0:35:13.10,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Wearing a tokkebi mask?\N- 1, 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.10,0:35:15.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,3. 1, 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.77,0:35:17.17,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Was he chasing you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.17,0:35:18.67,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,He tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.68,0:35:21.84,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kim Byungin died,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.91,0:35:25.28,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,trying to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.48,0:35:27.98,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Man in a mask
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.95,0:35:30.59,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,serves Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.12,0:35:34.99,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.32,0:35:37.39,Default,Spiky2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.39,0:35:40.06,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.06,0:35:41.90,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.90,0:35:43.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.27,0:35:46.50,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Directly "Death Note".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.70,0:35:48.17,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Here are the names of all officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.17,0:35:49.54,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,which need to be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.81,0:35:54.38,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,It remains to find a way to return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.04,0:35:56.18,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,If you collect everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.18,0:35:58.31,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,who is on our side, how many can we recruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.78,0:36:00.98,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,If collected from all over the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.98,0:36:02.88,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,then about 1000 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.18,0:36:05.45,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,-And that’s all?\N-That’s a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.02,0:36:07.79,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Risking your life is not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.49,0:36:10.19,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Then why didn’t they kill the governors?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.36,0:36:12.06,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Get rid of them and win the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.06,0:36:14.63,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Do you think we are some kind of bloodthirsty hyenas?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.16,0:36:17.57,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,Even low-born people like us,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.57,0:36:20.30,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,united, they can instill fear in the rulers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.97,0:36:22.30,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,That was our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.41,0:36:25.81,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,I see. So you wanted to attract attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.37,0:36:27.88,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,This is a good strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.88,0:36:30.45,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,You did not give them a reason to start fighting against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.88,0:36:32.55,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,Maybe we are stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.55,0:36:35.68,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,but we knew that if we came face to face, we would lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.62,0:36:39.39,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,They gathered 1000 warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.82,0:36:45.06,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,I risked my life for the sake of the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.06,0:36:47.20,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm up to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.50,0:36:49.63,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,-Royal chef?\N-Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.23,0:36:51.37,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Royal chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.93,0:36:53.94,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,How can we trust the man from the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.14,0:36:56.70,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.97,0:36:59.61,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll come back. Untie me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.31,0:37:04.78,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll untie it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.78,0:37:06.55,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Why are you looking so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:10.12,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,You are definitely younger than me. Where are your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.35,0:37:11.82,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,If you beg me, I won’t stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.75,0:37:13.76,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.66,0:37:17.49,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,You came of your own accord,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.49,0:37:19.19,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,but you won’t be able to leave like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.56,0:37:23.00,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Some kind of familiar situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.00,0:37:24.67,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,You saw all our faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.67,0:37:26.33,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,And they even found out about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.94,0:37:28.37,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Do you think you can leave alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.07,0:37:30.07,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.74,0:37:31.81,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.34,0:37:34.34,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Damn it. No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.61,0:37:35.84,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Royal Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.15,0:37:40.72,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,It seems my time has come. You'll hear something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.38,0:37:42.78,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Manbok.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.26,0:37:50.56,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.16,0:37:53.70,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.97,0:37:59.07,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Royal Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.87,0:38:01.80,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.98,0:38:12.75,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.75,0:38:15.15,Default,tira3,0,0,0,,-Royal cook.\N-Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.85,0:38:17.32,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:20.12,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.12,0:38:21.76,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.92,0:38:25.69,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,-Royal Chef.\N-I knew that you would save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.90,0:38:33.94,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.20,0:38:35.54,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.34,0:38:39.21,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,I heard that everyone who was unhappy in this country came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.21,0:38:40.78,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,So I went.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.78,0:38:44.11,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,And the people who disappeared from the palace are also here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.35,0:38:48.75,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,Royal cook, were you unhappy in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.05,0:38:50.92,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Watching what's going on in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.92,0:38:53.45,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,even I, the happiest of all, became unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.66,0:38:55.39,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,What's going on in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.39,0:38:57.26,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,About this, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:02.16,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Change clothes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.16,0:39:04.93,Default,tira3,0,0,0,,And cover yourself when you sneeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:18.81,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is the coronation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.81,0:39:20.88,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Every second counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.22,0:39:22.68,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,You did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.68,0:39:24.89,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,By the way, why are the followers of donghak
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.89,0:39:27.62,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,they are resisting more and more, because we have reined them in?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.42,0:39:31.33,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,Bad news is reaching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.33,0:39:34.13,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,The fact is that the more your opponent retreats,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.13,0:39:37.30,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,the more you justify yourself and act more violently.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:41.74,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,So the only solution is to teach them a tougher lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.17,0:39:43.30,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,After the ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.30,0:39:45.31,Default,shooting gallery 3,0,0,0,,I'll use the guns to regain control.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.61,0:39:49.48,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,I haven’t seen you with a sword for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.04,0:39:52.15,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Is the palace no longer safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.28,0:39:54.68,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,This is a gift from the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.48,0:39:57.89,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,-Queens?\N-Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.15,0:40:01.96,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I have bad news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.82,0:40:04.46,Default,tira3,0,0,0,,Benin sacrificed himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.46,0:40:06.23,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,to save the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.66,0:40:08.00,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,That’s how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.77,0:40:14.17,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,The only drawback of youth is stupidity:
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.17,0:40:16.40,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,sacrifice everything for fleeting feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.21,0:40:21.78,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,So the queen survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.01,0:40:24.05,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.11,0:40:28.38,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,The king saved the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.52,0:40:32.62,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,So, that means they're both alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.59,0:40:35.92,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,This makes me think:
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.92,0:40:38.29,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,there is no one to rely on here, or are they that smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.66,0:40:41.50,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Sorry. Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.70,0:40:49.47,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,The time we tried
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:51.67,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,give the queen arsenic,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.04,0:40:55.31,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,the king found out about this and came running.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.22,0:41:05.35,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.09,0:41:12.09,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,there was a rat who was listening all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.87,0:41:23.67,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,You gave it to me as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.94,0:41:26.34,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,You personally blinded and stunned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.34,0:41:27.94,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,I'm overly sensitive,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.94,0:41:29.58,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,apparently, because of the upcoming ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.62,0:41:36.58,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,I understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.85,0:41:38.95,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,We will hold the ceremony as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.72,0:41:45.33,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,Don’t forget that those two already defeated you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.36,0:41:47.93,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,I'll bet my life
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.06,0:41:50.77,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,for this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.77,0:41:59.07,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.61,0:42:02.48,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,We will be able to pass the gates in Hanyang and the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.45,0:42:06.78,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,And what did you come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.78,0:42:09.78,Default,tira3,0,0,0,,These people are used to eating fresh food.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.78,0:42:12.05,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,How long can they last without fresh food?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.82,0:42:15.29,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen is extremely picky.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.96,0:42:17.19,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,She won’t hold out for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.40,0:42:26.60,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,Not this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.20,0:42:29.20,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,To.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.07,0:42:31.11,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,To.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.51,0:42:36.61,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,Therefore
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.61,0:42:40.82,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,this door will not be closed under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.32,0:42:44.02,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,Groceries are delivered through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.19,0:42:53.39,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,We need to find out about the wagon for royal offerings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.83,0:42:56.70,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,The palace has a whole system for royal offerings.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.70,0:43:01.37,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,More than 50 such carts come to the royal kitchen every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.37,0:43:04.41,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,Moreover, there are special monthly offerings.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.41,0:43:07.28,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,And there are also offerings that come every 4 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.71,0:43:11.48,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,-Simpler. Let's get straight to the point.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.88,0:43:13.98,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,62 carts will arrive at the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.98,0:43:16.05,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,on the morning of the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.05,0:43:18.32,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,But a state of emergency has been declared.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.69,0:43:22.56,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,I’m sure the royal offerings will be checked with special attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.56,0:43:26.33,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,But what if there is a cart that no one knows about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.33,0:43:29.63,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Inspector's cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.37,0:43:34.27,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,Well, you're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.27,0:43:37.77,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,This cart is ours. Skip them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.57,0:43:39.74,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,-Okay. Come in.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.74,0:43:40.98,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,Chief Inspector
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.98,0:43:42.68,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,usually swaps carts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.08,0:43:44.25,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,Swaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.25,0:43:46.51,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,Well, not all officials are picky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.51,0:43:48.45,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,He changes some of the offerings
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.45,0:43:50.42,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,for slightly lower quality products.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.42,0:43:52.42,Default,shooting gallery3,0,0,0,,And there are inspectors in the cart
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.42,0:43:54.92,Default,tyra3,0,0,0,,products for which he exchanges offerings.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.29,0:43:57.96,Default,shooting3,0,0,0,,And only a handful of people know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.96,0:43:59.86,Default,tier3,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.86,0:44:02.46,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,This is not a palace, but a den of thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.46,0:44:04.83,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.83,0:44:06.43,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I thought it was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.10,0:44:11.14,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Rotten wood has holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.07,0:44:14.84,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,And we can use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.44,0:44:18.11,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Okay, let's all hold out our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.48,0:44:19.78,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Let's.\N-Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.78,0:44:20.98,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Hands here. Forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.98,0:44:22.65,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Here.\N-God.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.65,0:44:23.72,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.72,0:44:24.92,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.09,0:44:26.35,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,-Forward!\N-Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.85,0:44:27.92,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.73,0:44:42.44,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Ready?\N-Yes, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.34,0:44:48.41,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Manbok.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.81,0:44:49.88,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.31,0:44:55.02,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-And he has changed.\N-Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.10,0:45:45.27,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.90,0:45:49.27,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.47,0:45:55.21,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,You were special to Kim So-yeon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.96,0:46:12.53,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I want to bury him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.16,0:46:16.30,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.38,0:46:34.95,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.82,0:46:41.92,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.54,0:47:02.88,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.78,0:47:08.18,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,The Queen must prepare for the birth of her child
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.18,0:47:10.62,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,with mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.79,0:47:16.39,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,but since this is impossible, I would like to help her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.66,0:47:20.80,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Come to ask where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.80,0:47:22.96,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,The Queen bears an heir, so
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:25.33,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I can’t tell you its location.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.33,0:47:26.93,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I provided her with everything she needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.93,0:47:28.54,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.94,0:47:35.11,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.16,0:47:52.93,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,The King is not dead
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.93,0:47:56.56,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,Is she really getting ready to give birth?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.80,0:48:00.37,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,You didn’t harm her, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.87,0:48:04.11,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,The Queen has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.54,0:48:07.37,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,We defend her honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.61,0:48:11.31,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Run away?\N-She believes,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.31,0:48:14.01,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,that the king is alive, she even left the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.88,0:48:17.25,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.02,0:48:21.26,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,but I will tell you openly, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.19,0:48:26.46,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Your behavior does not help our family,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.46,0:48:29.43,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,on the contrary, it tarnishes her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.93,0:48:31.20,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Don’t you understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.20,0:48:33.47,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,what will our future generation say about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.97,0:48:37.57,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Are you in a position to talk like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.54,0:48:42.91,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,At least I have a sense of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.91,0:48:45.75,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,Your shame is a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.75,0:48:47.98,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,If there is no shame, there is no crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.98,0:48:49.78,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,If not for the sake of family honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.58,0:48:53.49,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,then why did you come so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.49,0:48:54.89,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,Even the king was harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.79,0:48:59.86,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,My time will not end,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.53,0:49:03.83,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,until I want it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.80,0:49:45.07,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,You hear everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.02,0:49:59.05,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-There.\N-Teho.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.06,0:50:02.12,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.72,0:50:03.96,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,We got there before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.19,0:50:05.49,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.49,0:50:07.39,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,God, my knees hurt so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.60,0:50:08.63,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.93,0:50:10.97,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:16.14,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Glad you're alive.\NYou've been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.44,0:50:18.27,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,We're glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.67,0:50:21.24,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Who has cigarettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.28,0:50:23.38,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it's cold here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.22,0:50:32.55,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t mind a cold can of beer right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.39,0:50:37.19,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,It's not that great here,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.19,0:50:38.53,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,so why did we come?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.53,0:50:41.93,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,It’s safest here, \Nno one knows about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.56,0:50:45.70,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Is that so? Even if you want it, you won't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.33,0:50:47.70,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,God, my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.68,0:50:56.78,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.55,0:50:59.65,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,It’s not time yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.65,0:51:01.08,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,How long can you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.08,0:51:03.88,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,This is the last chance. You need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.69,0:51:13.96,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,It’s already time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.87,0:51:27.11,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,So delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.12,0:51:40.29,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Here.\N-Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.97,0:52:01.31,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.15,0:52:23.42,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Very tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.54,0:52:41.54,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,Looking for trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.74,0:52:45.68,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,People like me will die anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.68,0:52:47.18,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.34,0:52:50.31,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,And you have the highest position in all of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.31,0:52:53.88,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,If we closed our eyes to everyone, wouldn’t we live in abundance?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.72,0:52:56.89,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,There was a time when I
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.59,0:52:59.96,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,lived in a nightmare that I had to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.29,0:53:03.53,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I endured everything only with the thought of taking revenge on those
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.80,0:53:07.83,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,who killed my parents, brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.90,0:53:12.10,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Then I began to see the rotting of Joseon
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.77,0:53:15.44,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,and the people who suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.24,0:53:20.34,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,And you have a keen eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.58,0:53:22.95,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I thought that everyone in the palace was blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.42,0:53:27.15,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,If everything works out,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.99,0:53:31.29,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,you won’t become like them, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.13,0:53:36.43,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.00,0:53:40.63,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I dream of a new Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.67,0:53:46.07,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Did you call this an “election”?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.07,0:53:48.07,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.07,0:53:50.47,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,When people choose their king.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.71,0:53:52.08,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Yes. Elections.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.58,0:53:54.95,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,But this does not mean that the world will become ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.45,0:54:05.22,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Well, that's already good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.76,0:54:08.23,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,You can change it if something goes wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.53,0:54:12.93,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,The king and the queen are both madmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.56,0:54:16.93,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Well, go to bed early, we have a big deal ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.87,0:54:21.97,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.88,0:54:29.11,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,If you really are from the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.85,0:54:32.02,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,so you know how it all ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.95,0:54:35.19,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,What will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.39,0:54:41.59,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,You will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.70,0:54:47.73,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,But I'll bet everything on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.23,0:54:52.40,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Aren't you always on the winning side?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.07,0:54:54.30,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.30,0:54:56.17,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,I've already screwed up in this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.81,0:54:58.94,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Even if I put everything on the line, it’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:03.41,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,So you put all your eggs in my basket?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.31,0:55:07.18,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Yes. All. I went all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.99,0:55:13.96,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Even if I fail, I will do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.26,0:55:17.73,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Until fate gets tired of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.40,0:55:20.73,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I won’t let her eat me up so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.05,0:55:42.69,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I can’t believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.29,0:55:45.52,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,that I am stuck here and cannot help the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.32,0:55:48.19,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Do you think the queen has met him?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.19,0:55:52.10,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Even if they met, what can they do on their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.90,0:55:55.90,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I don’t think there is
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.90,0:55:57.90,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,way to stop the coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.84,0:56:04.21,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,And if you use Kim Hwan...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.11,0:56:10.25,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.79,0:56:17.99,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Has he come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.42,0:56:19.92,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Brought something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.06,0:56:24.19,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.00,0:56:29.67,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Collecting requests,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.67,0:56:31.23,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.60,0:56:36.04,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,But is there anything else I can do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.14,0:56:39.31,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Help?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.31,0:56:41.65,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Yes. Ask for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.41,0:56:44.25,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-Everything?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.85,0:56:47.92,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,I will do everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.59,0:56:54.73,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.39,0:56:58.56,Default,HALTENUT,0,0,0,,do you trust people that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.60,0:57:02.70,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Your job is to feed the scammers?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.87,0:57:05.04,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,How are you going to survive in this cruel world?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.07,0:57:08.04,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.41,0:57:12.24,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,-What is wrong?\N-I don’t know what exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.21,0:57:15.55,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,but since you say so, I won’t do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.55,0:57:16.91,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,You're wrong about that
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.88,0:57:20.58,Default,HAZELT,0,0,0,,that you trust people like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.55,0:57:27.16,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I tried to become friends with you in order to find out information.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.19,0:57:29.43,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And you had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.20,0:57:34.66,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What is all this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.50,0:57:41.54,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,That is
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.31,0:57:46.88,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,all this time you didn’t consider me a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.34,0:57:48.38,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.41,0:57:50.81,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I didn’t count you
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.18,0:57:53.68,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,not a second with your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.82,0:57:58.42,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,So don’t even think about coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.59,0:58:36.59,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.09,0:58:39.16,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You blame it on
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.53,0:58:41.36,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,we can’t use it anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.10,0:58:44.60,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I didn’t look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.10,0:58:49.17,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Now before my eyes such a dishonor has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.12,0:59:00.88,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You must be very tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.36,0:59:09.96,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I don’t dilute with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.86,0:59:12.20,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I mix it with soju.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.00,0:59:15.93,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Golden ratio, somek.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.37,0:59:24.47,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It seems that you are dreaming of something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.54,0:59:28.75,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.43,0:59:53.17,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What did you dream about?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.37,0:59:55.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The portrait of the king was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.54,1:00:00.71,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Fire consumed all of Seongwonjong.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.24,1:00:05.18,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And I was stuck here alone when the fire...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.23,1:00:23.97,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Today is a significant day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.97,1:00:25.54,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Not a drop can be uttered.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.63,1:00:55.83,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Powder me so that without a single flaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.41,1:01:09.61,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Day of the accession ceremony
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.83,1:01:23.36,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,For the safety of Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.36,1:01:26.30,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I ordered a curfew to be introduced in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.73,1:01:30.10,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Everyone, with the exception of warriors,\Nmust remain inside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.20,1:01:32.24,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.24,1:01:35.01,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I did not invite the royal family, nor the musicians.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.84,1:01:37.77,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Let the ceremony pass peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.77,1:01:39.18,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Even the royal family?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.18,1:01:40.88,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It will be safer this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.88,1:01:41.91,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.29,1:01:53.36,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Everything I say is correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.66,1:01:57.89,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.07,1:02:08.57,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, aren’t you scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.07,1:02:10.21,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.21,1:02:12.78,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Believers whom I sometimes met on the street,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.78,1:02:15.01,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,they said that my ancestors would give me a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.58,1:02:17.11,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,So I’ll use it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.52,1:02:19.58,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.25,1:02:24.39,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,today more than any other day,\Nyou look like the queen I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.49,1:02:30.13,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,There is no need for such a mood.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.13,1:02:32.80,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It’s like the last day.\NAnd this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.53,1:02:35.03,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You are right, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.01,1:02:46.81,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Meet us at night in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.84,1:02:50.41,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Of course. It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.32,1:02:55.52,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Don’t die.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.52,1:02:57.49,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What is so good in life?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.49,1:03:01.16,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Even if our life is unhappy and pathetic, let's live longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.49,1:03:04.96,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,If everything works out now,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.96,1:03:08.50,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I will “vote” for you, or whatever, \Nin place of the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.80,1:03:11.90,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.11,1:03:17.24,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Well, shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.97,1:03:19.58,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.48,1:03:22.98,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Criminal Lee Kyung-eun
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.98,1:03:25.55,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,hid the identities of the traitors, the followers of donghak.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.82,1:03:26.92,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,He will be deprived of his position
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.92,1:03:28.62,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,and sent to link.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.25,1:03:30.89,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Criminal Hong Duil
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.89,1:03:32.72,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,lost a firearm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.72,1:03:34.22,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,He will work in the office
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.22,1:03:36.63,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Ganghwado for 600 days as a state slave.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.30,1:03:40.86,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,After the ascent ceremony
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.86,1:03:42.60,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I will immediately carry out the sentence.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.17,1:03:53.18,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,There were no achievements to \Nattribute anything to the current king.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.18,1:03:55.28,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,We had a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.35,1:04:01.02,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The king’s funeral is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.02,1:04:03.45,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Is it appropriate to smile until your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.69,1:04:06.99,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.23,1:04:12.10,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,How will the ceremony go, will there be any problems -
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.53,1:04:14.16,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,it all depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.63,1:04:17.63,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes! I will definitely do my duty
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.63,1:04:20.07,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,so that the absence of the Minister of War does not affect anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.34,1:04:22.71,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.37,1:04:28.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,when will Kim Byungin return to the palace?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.58,1:04:32.32,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I suppose you want to know the fate of the letter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.35,1:04:35.32,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Everyone is worried about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.32,1:04:38.02,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. I'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.29,1:04:40.66,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.19,1:04:44.59,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Now the king and the Phunyang clan of Cho
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.20,1:04:48.13,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,will be my puppets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.45,1:05:07.48,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Sir, I cry double to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.25,1:05:10.35,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Doubly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.93,1:05:27.60,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Hey, we're good people.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.97,1:05:32.01,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,But if the Chief Inspector or anyone else sees anything suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.24,1:05:35.75,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,we can really become bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.08,1:05:39.22,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I don’t care whether human nature is good or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.22,1:05:41.62,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It all depends on what they are doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.39,1:05:45.39,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Be more natural, more natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.49,1:05:46.59,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.97,1:06:04.17,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.72,1:06:20.49,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Uncomfortable, move a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.66,1:06:23.73,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.06,1:06:25.46,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Is this an elbow?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.73,1:06:27.03,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Hare poke at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.56,1:06:30.00,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,If you press on my stomach like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.70,1:06:32.37,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.71,1:06:38.74,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Move over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.81,1:06:43.01,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.05,1:06:46.48,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Finally I see something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.52,1:06:55.76,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Right here...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.40,1:07:01.50,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,No time for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.17,1:07:04.30,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,You're right, you need to pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.17,1:07:07.44,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It’s good that I didn’t hide here with some guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.24,1:07:09.61,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Why are you talking about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.71,1:07:13.81,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Move a little, I’ll change my position.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.45,1:07:19.58,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Mommies.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.72,1:07:30.66,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Now I’m comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.26,1:07:34.96,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I agree, this pose is the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.17,1:07:47.14,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,We will be caught because of the roar of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.44,1:07:48.95,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Why are you so scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.18,1:07:52.01,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,This is not only my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.43,1:08:05.03,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,And not only because of fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.03,1:08:08.87,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It’s also because of you, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.07,1:08:17.51,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Not out of fear for me either.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.53,1:08:45.37,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,It's from England.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.37,1:08:47.10,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Much more powerful and faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.44,1:08:54.34,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,If the king appears in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.41,1:08:57.51,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,aim for his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.47,1:09:20.84,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,New, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.00,1:09:23.54,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.14,1:09:26.51,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.20,1:09:47.53,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:09:59.88,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,-Search.\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.69,1:10:18.13,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Nothing suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.03,1:10:53.30,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.32,1:11:17.19,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,As soon as the ceremony is over,\NI will finish them all off.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.19,1:11:20.26,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The same feeling as before the appearance of the main boss in games.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.26,1:11:21.89,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I'm good with knives.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.73,1:11:25.43,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I'm crazy. \NFrom the words about a special task
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.49,1:11:26.80,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,my heart boiled.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.80,1:11:29.90,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,The changes that you were so afraid of have already begun.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.90,1:11:32.17,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.20,1:11:34.04,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,Is the king on the same side with the donghak followers?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.04,1:11:36.81,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I am a relative of those you killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.81,1:11:41.51,Default,ZINA,0,0,0,,I am the king of those people whom you neglected!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.53,0:26:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,


